---
/**
 * /animal-agricultural-flooring — Animal & Agricultural Rubber Flooring hub (UAE).
 *
 * Bespoke page (not the YAML-driven generic HubPage), built to mirror the
 * structure and styling of src/pages/acoustic-soundproofing-flooring.astro and
 * src/pages/gym-fitness-flooring.astro. The `animal` hub is excluded from
 * getStaticPaths in src/pages/[...slug].astro to avoid a route collision;
 * src/content/hubs/animal.yaml stays as data for the child products.
 *
 * ─── IMPLEMENTATION NOTES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *  - Images use plain <img> from /public (not astro:assets <Image />) to match
 *    the two reference hub pages and the explicit build-brief instruction:
 *    every <img> carries verbatim alt text, explicit width/height and
 *    loading="lazy" (hero is eager + fetchpriority). This knowingly supersedes
 *    the CLAUDE.md "<Image /> mandatory" line for parity with the sibling hubs.
 *  - Brand tokens (charcoal / industrial / amber from tailwind.config.mjs) are
 *    used throughout rather than raw neutral-* utilities, so the page stays
 *    consistent with the acoustic + gym hubs and the design system. The result
 *    is the same dark-accent + amber-highlight + subtle-border aesthetic the
 *    brief describes.
 *  - "Lucide" icons are rendered as inline SVG (Lucide path data) — the project
 *    has no icon dependency and CLAUDE.md forbids zero-JS-breaking adds.
 *  - Per this task's brief: NO page-level JSON-LD (no FAQPage / Product /
 *    LocalBusiness). The visible breadcrumb still uses <Breadcrumbs>, whose
 *    BreadcrumbList JSON-LD is an inherent side-effect of that shared nav
 *    component (kept for structural + a11y parity with the sibling hubs).
 *
 * ─── DATA INTEGRITY FLAGS (CLAUDE.md §0 + §6) — confirm before go-live ─────
 *  - Image assets supplied 2026-08-29 and re-encoded in place with sharp
 *    (mozjpeg q80, progressive) — dimensions unchanged: hero + why-use +
 *    dubai-desert are 1408×768; the four product photos and the tech-spec
 *    infographic are 1024×1024. Originals backed up to the session scratchpad.
 *  - Zain Linkmats: dropped from this hub for now (per client 2026-08-29). The
 *    product route /outdoor-pavers/linkmats still exists and is noindex +
 *    sitemap-excluded; re-add a card here when it is ready.
 *  - Hero CTA: brief says -> /contact-request-quote/. Site-wide convention (see
 *    memory + both sibling hubs) is the in-page #request-quote anchor + a form
 *    posting to /contact. Followed the convention to keep "0 dead links".
 *  - Canonical: the brief's rukanalzain.com host is replaced by the production
 *    domain https://ruknalzain.ae; the path is passed relative so Seo.astro
 *    builds the absolute URL from astro.config's `site` (no trailing slash).
 *  - Netlify Forms handler / CRM endpoint, success page and privacy-policy link
 *    still TODO (shared with the other hub forms).
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 */
