---

<BaseLayout
  title="Horse Stable Mats & Agricultural Rubber Flooring UAE | Rukn Al Zain"
  description="Durable, non-slip rubber mats and pavers for horse stables, dairy farms and animal enclosures across the UAE. Built for heavy use and easy maintenance."
  canonical="/animal-agricultural-flooring"
  ogImage={HERO_IMG}
  ogImageAlt={HERO_ALT}
>
  <article>
    {/* Breadcrumb strip — emits BreadcrumbList JSON-LD via the shared component */}
    <div class="border-b border-industrial-300 bg-industrial-100">
      <div class={`${container} py-4`}>
        <Breadcrumbs
          trail={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Animal & Agricultural Flooring' }]}
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* ─── 1. HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */}
    <header class="bg-charcoal-700 text-white">
      <div class={`${container} py-14 sm:py-16`}>
        <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
              Animal &amp; Agricultural Rubber Flooring in the UAE
            </h1>

            {/* AEO direct-answer block */}
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl border-l-[3px] border-amber-400 pl-4 text-lg text-industrial-100">
              Rukn Al Zain supplies heavy-duty rubber stable mats, dairy farm flooring, and
              outdoor agricultural pavers across Dubai and the UAE. Specially designed for equine
              facilities, livestock enclosures, and farm walkways, our rubber flooring solutions
              deliver anti-fatigue comfort, non-slip traction, thermal insulation, and
              low-maintenance hygiene under extreme climate conditions.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a href="#request-quote" class={`${primaryCta} focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal-700`}>
                Request Bulk / Wholesale Quote
              </a>
              <a
                href="https://wa.me/971505698195"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class={`${ghostCta} focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal-700`}
              >
                Chat on WhatsApp
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <figure class="m-0">
            <img
              src={HERO_IMG}
              alt={HERO_ALT}
              title="Heavy-duty rubber stable mats in an equestrian stall in Dubai, UAE"
              width="1408"
              height="768"
              fetchpriority="high"
              decoding="async"
              class="h-auto w-full rounded border border-white/10"
            />
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm text-industrial-300">
              Heavy-duty recycled-rubber stable mats installed across an equestrian stall in
              Dubai.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    {/* ─── 2. TRUST & VALUE INDICATORS ────────────────────────────────────── */}
    <section aria-labelledby="trust-h" class={`${sectionShell} bg-white`}>
      <div class={container}>
        <h2 id="trust-h" class={h2}>Designed for Animal Welfare &amp; UAE Climate Resilience</h2>
        <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
          {
            trustBar.map((it) => (
              <div class="rounded border border-industrial-300 border-l-[3px] border-l-amber-400 bg-industrial-100 p-5">
                <span class={iconChip} aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg {...svgAttrs} set:html={icon[it.icon]} />
                </span>
                <dt class="font-heading font-semibold text-charcoal">{it.term}</dt>
                <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-600">{it.desc}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ─── 3. CONCRETE SUBFLOOR CHALLENGES (PROBLEM VS. SOLUTION) ──────────── */}
    <section aria-labelledby="challenges-h" class={`${sectionShell} bg-industrial-100`}>
      <div class={container}>
        <h2 id="challenges-h" class={h2}>
          Concrete Subfloor Challenges &amp; Agricultural Rubber Flooring Solution
        </h2>
        <p class={lede}>
          Equine facilities, livestock enclosures, and farm walkways across the UAE face severe
          daily wear, extreme environmental exposure, and health risks to animals when relying on
          raw concrete floors. Specially engineered rubber mats and pavers deliver a long-lasting
          protective barrier that addresses every core structural and operational challenge.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
          {
            challenges.map((c) => (
              <article class="flex flex-col rounded border border-industrial-300 bg-white p-6">
                <div class="border-l-[3px] border-l-danger pl-4">
                  <p class="font-heading text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-danger">
                    The problem
                  </p>
                  <h3 class="mt-1 font-heading font-semibold text-charcoal">{c.problem}</h3>
                  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-600">{c.problemDesc}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 border-l-[3px] border-l-success pl-4">
                  <p class="font-heading text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-success">
                    The solution
                  </p>
                  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-600">{c.solutionDesc}</p>
                </div>
              </article>
            ))
          }
        </div>

